sequenceDiagram
  participant Admin as Admin dashboard
  participant BFF as Next.js BFF
  participant API as NestJS use case
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant Public as Marketing SSR

  Admin->>BFF: PATCH /api/backend/admin/site-settings
  BFF->>API: PATCH /admin/site-settings
  API->>DB: Upsert site_settings JSON
  API-->>BFF: Updated settings
  BFF-->>Admin: 200 OK

  Public->>API: GET /site-settings (public)
  API->>DB: Read singleton row
  API-->>Public: Hero, SEO, logos
  Public-->>Public: Render + revalidate cache
